                  "html": "<i>Smelt</i> at a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Furnace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">furnace</a> with a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Silver_bar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">silver bar</a>. Select &quot;silver bar&quot; under &quot;Casting Metals &amp; Glass&quot; section on the interface, and then select the &quot;silver sickle&quot; option in the &quot;Silver Casting&quot; section.",
                  "text": "Smelt at a furnace with a silver bar. Select \"silver bar\" under \"Casting Metals & Glass\" section on the interface, and then select the \"silver sickle\" option in the \"Silver Casting\" section.",
